<title>UK: Abbey National sets 100 mln Ecu four-year.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 100 mln Ecu four-year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.0 PCT   MATURITY    12.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.055   PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.68     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.375</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 9.50 PCT APRIL 2000 OAT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
